<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on March 20.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on March 20.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				March 20	     March 19</p>
<p>Fed acct			 5.369		  9.035</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	  33.331		 29.811</p>
<p>Cash balance		  38.700		 38.847</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,  subject to limit	5,282.066</p>
<p>	    5,282.267</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $4 million were issued and $84 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
